{"duration": 312.2666875, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.94, "text": "This is Machu Piccu. The year is 1912. A field of rubble. And this is also Machu Piccu.", "words": [[0.0, 0.38, " This"], [0.38, 0.68, " is"], [0.68, 1.04, " Machu"], [1.04, 1.42, " Piccu."], [1.82, 2.02, " The"], [2.02, 2.24, " year"], [2.24, 2.4, " is"], [2.4, 3.36, " 1912."], [3.74, 3.98, " A"], [3.98, 4.18, " field"], [4.18, 4.4, " of"], [4.4, 4.86, " rubble."], [5.24, 5.38, " And"], [5.38, 5.6, " this"], [5.6, 5.86, " is"], [5.86, 6.1, " also"], [6.1, 6.5, " Machu"], [6.5, 6.94, " Piccu."]]}, {"start": 7.3, "end": 11.66, "text": "The same place. Over a hundred years and one decision. What to show.", "words": [[7.3, 7.48, " The"], [7.48, 7.7, " same"], [7.7, 8.16, " place."], [8.8, 9.02, " Over"], [9.02, 9.12, " a"], [9.12, 9.42, " hundred"], [9.42, 9.8, " years"], [9.8, 10.02, " and"], [10.02, 10.2, " one"], [10.2, 10.7, " decision."], [11.02, 11.18, " What"], [11.18, 11.42, " to"], [11.42, 11.66, " show."]]}, {"start": 12.64, "end": 16.44, "text": "Every vlog shows you this version. And nobody is lying to you.", "words": [[12.64, 12.96, " Every"], [12.96, 13.32, " vlog"], [13.32, 13.62, " shows"], [13.62, 13.82, " you"], [13.82, 14.02, " this"], [14.02, 14.42, " version."], [14.88, 15.1, " And"], [15.1, 15.4, " nobody"], [15.4, 15.74, " is"], [15.74, 15.92, " lying"], [15.92, 16.16, " to"], [16.16, 16.44, " you."]]}, {"start": 17.34, "end": 21.94, "text": "A frame does not lie. A frame chooses. Eight places from one vlog.", "words": [[17.34, 17.58, " A"], [17.58, 17.78, " frame"], [17.78, 18.0, " does"], [18.0, 18.22, " not"], [18.22, 18.54, " lie."], [19.0, 19.2, " A"], [19.2, 19.4, " frame"], [19.4, 19.88, " chooses."], [20.54, 20.8, " Eight"], [20.8, 21.14, " places"], [21.14, 21.4, " from"], [21.4, 21.62, " one"], [21.62, 21.94, " vlog."]]}, {"start": 22.48, "end": 26.46, "text": "Then I show you how it really is. Seven ways a frame changes the world.", "words": [[22.48, 22.62, " Then"], [22.62, 22.82, " I"], [22.82, 22.98, " show"], [22.98, 23.16, " you"], [23.16, 23.28, " how"], [23.28, 23.48, " it"], [23.48, 23.72, " really"], [23.72, 24.1, " is."], [24.46, 24.74, " Seven"], [24.74, 25.02, " ways"], [25.02, 25.26, " a"], [25.26, 25.44, " frame"], [25.44, 25.92, " changes"], [25.92, 26.16, " the"], [26.16, 26.46, " world."]]}, {"start": 26.46, "end": 34.02, "text": "Time. Scale. Reach. Hour. Choice. Height. Weather.", "words": [[26.46, 27.54, " Time."], [28.16, 28.54, " Scale."], [29.36, 29.68, " Reach."], [30.44, 30.8, " Hour."], [31.5, 31.9, " Choice."], [32.7, 33.34, " Height."], [33.7, 34.02, " Weather."]]}, {"start": 34.72, "end": 38.04, "text": "Every place gets a verdict. We start with Machu Piccu.", "words": [[34.72, 35.02, " Every"], [35.02, 35.3, " place"], [35.3, 35.58, " gets"], [35.58, 35.74, " a"], [35.74, 36.06, " verdict."], [36.6, 36.78, " We"], [36.78, 37.0, " start"], [37.0, 37.28, " with"], [37.28, 37.66, " Machu"], [37.66, 38.04, " Piccu."]]}, {"start": 39.9, "end": 45.38, "text": "This is how the place looked in 1912. Hiram Bingham's expedition found a field of rubble.", "words": [[39.9, 40.1, " This"], [40.1, 40.32, " is"], [40.32, 40.46, " how"], [40.46, 40.68, " the"], [40.68, 40.86, " place"], [40.86, 41.1, " looked"], [41.1, 41.36, " in"], [41.36, 42.1, " 1912."], [42.6, 42.82, " Hiram"], [42.82, 43.32, " Bingham's"], [43.32, 43.92, " expedition"], [43.92, 44.46, " found"], [44.46, 44.68, " a"], [44.68, 44.86, " field"], [44.86, 45.06, " of"], [45.06, 45.38, " rubble."]]}, {"start": 45.68, "end": 52.28, "text": "Then came the restoration. 1929 to 1971. The vlog shows the place after the work.", "words": [[45.68, 45.98, " Then"], [45.98, 46.22, " came"], [46.22, 46.4, " the"], [46.4, 47.08, " restoration."], [47.94, 48.58, " 1929"], [48.58, 48.98, " to"], [48.98, 49.8, " 1971."], [50.28, 50.48, " The"], [50.48, 50.78, " vlog"], [50.78, 51.1, " shows"], [51.1, 51.34, " the"], [51.34, 51.54, " place"], [51.54, 51.82, " after"], [51.82, 52.02, " the"], [52.02, 52.28, " work."]]}, {"start": 52.28, "end": 58.8, "text": "And today the citadel admits up to 4,500 visitors a day. In peak season, 5,600.", "words": [[52.28, 52.8, " And"], [52.8, 53.1, " today"], [53.1, 53.36, " the"], [53.36, 53.88, " citadel"], [53.88, 54.28, " admits"], [54.28, 54.56, " up"], [54.56, 54.78, " to"], [54.78, 55.02, " 4"], [55.02, 55.48, ",500"], [55.48, 56.02, " visitors"], [56.02, 56.24, " a"], [56.24, 56.56, " day."], [56.96, 57.08, " In"], [57.08, 57.32, " peak"], [57.32, 57.78, " season,"], [58.04, 58.3, " 5"], [58.3, 58.8, ",600."]]}, {"start": 59.4, "end": 63.86, "text": "The clip shows no crowd and that is a choice too. Verdict the frame chooses.", "words": [[59.4, 59.58, " The"], [59.58, 59.74, " clip"], [59.74, 60.04, " shows"], [60.04, 60.28, " no"], [60.28, 60.64, " crowd"], [60.64, 61.0, " and"], [61.0, 61.16, " that"], [61.16, 61.34, " is"], [61.34, 61.42, " a"], [61.42, 61.64, " choice"], [61.64, 62.14, " too."], [62.54, 62.9, " Verdict"], [62.9, 63.12, " the"], [63.12, 63.34, " frame"], [63.34, 63.86, " chooses."]]}, {"start": 65.78, "end": 71.42, "text": "A beautiful frame. And not one person in it. Without a person, a mountain has no scale.", "words": [[65.78, 65.86, " A"], [65.86, 66.26, " beautiful"], [66.26, 66.8, " frame."], [67.42, 67.48, " And"], [67.48, 67.74, " not"], [67.74, 67.94, " one"], [67.94, 68.32, " person"], [68.32, 68.52, " in"], [68.52, 68.88, " it."], [69.12, 69.36, " Without"], [69.36, 69.58, " a"], [69.58, 69.96, " person,"], [70.24, 70.36, " a"], [70.36, 70.64, " mountain"], [70.64, 70.88, " has"], [70.88, 71.1, " no"], [71.1, 71.42, " scale."]]}, {"start": 73.64, "end": 80.46, "text": "Look at Amadablam. 6,812 meters. For several days, it dominates the eastern sky", "words": [[73.64, 73.78, " Look"], [73.78, 73.96, " at"], [73.96, 74.58, " Amadablam."], [75.1, 75.48, " 6"], [75.48, 76.6, ",812"], [76.6, 77.04, " meters."], [77.54, 77.76, " For"], [77.76, 78.08, " several"], [78.08, 78.56, " days,"], [78.78, 78.94, " it"], [78.94, 79.4, " dominates"], [79.4, 79.62, " the"], [79.62, 80.04, " eastern"], [80.04, 80.46, " sky"]]}, {"start": 80.46, "end": 85.9, "text": "for anyone trekking to Everest Base Camp. And these are the Gokyo Lakes in Sagarmatha", "words": [[80.46, 80.9, " for"], [80.9, 81.32, " anyone"], [81.32, 81.76, " trekking"], [81.76, 82.02, " to"], [82.02, 82.32, " Everest"], [82.32, 82.68, " Base"], [82.68, 83.02, " Camp."], [83.38, 83.54, " And"], [83.54, 83.82, " these"], [83.82, 84.0, " are"], [84.0, 84.14, " the"], [84.14, 84.44, " Gokyo"], [84.44, 84.84, " Lakes"], [84.84, 85.3, " in"], [85.3, 85.9, " Sagarmatha"]]}, {"start": 85.9, "end": 91.14, "text": "National Park. Between 4,700 and 5,000 meters above sea level.", "words": [[85.9, 86.4, " National"], [86.4, 86.84, " Park."], [87.46, 87.5, " Between"], [87.5, 87.86, " 4"], [87.86, 88.34, ",700"], [88.34, 89.0, " and"], [89.0, 89.4, " 5"], [89.4, 89.68, ",000"], [89.68, 90.12, " meters"], [90.12, 90.5, " above"], [90.5, 90.8, " sea"], [90.8, 91.14, " level."]]}, {"start": 91.52, "end": 97.04, "text": "Now find the two tiny figures on the slope. That is the real scale. Verdict reality is", "words": [[91.52, 91.72, " Now"], [91.72, 91.96, " find"], [91.96, 92.18, " the"], [92.18, 92.4, " two"], [92.4, 92.74, " tiny"], [92.74, 93.06, " figures"], [93.06, 93.24, " on"], [93.24, 93.46, " the"], [93.46, 93.72, " slope."], [94.18, 94.32, " That"], [94.32, 94.52, " is"], [94.52, 94.68, " the"], [94.68, 94.88, " real"], [94.88, 95.42, " scale."], [95.94, 96.3, " Verdict"], [96.3, 96.76, " reality"], [96.76, 97.04, " is"]]}, {"start": 97.04, "end": 104.61, "text": "bigger. Two cyclists and a red mesa. An honest frame. But it is a fraction of the road.", "words": [[97.04, 97.34, " bigger."], [99.41, 99.69, " Two"], [99.69, 100.27, " cyclists"], [100.27, 100.45, " and"], [100.45, 100.57, " a"], [100.57, 100.75, " red"], [100.75, 101.13, " mesa."], [101.69, 101.97, " An"], [101.97, 102.23, " honest"], [102.23, 102.63, " frame."], [103.13, 103.29, " But"], [103.29, 103.45, " it"], [103.45, 103.65, " is"], [103.65, 103.79, " a"], [103.79, 104.05, " fraction"], [104.05, 104.19, " of"], [104.19, 104.35, " the"], [104.35, 104.61, " road."]]}, {"start": 106.91, "end": 113.77, "text": "This road is White Rim in Canyonlands National Park. 71 miles, about 115 kilometers.", "words": [[106.91, 107.23, " This"], [107.23, 107.53, " road"], [107.53, 107.75, " is"], [107.75, 108.03, " White"], [108.03, 108.25, " Rim"], [108.25, 108.73, " in"], [108.73, 109.33, " Canyonlands"], [109.33, 109.83, " National"], [109.83, 110.29, " Park."], [110.65, 111.09, " 71"], [111.09, 111.69, " miles,"], [111.99, 112.27, " about"], [112.27, 112.97, " 115"], [112.97, 113.77, " kilometers."]]}, {"start": 114.23, "end": 119.49, "text": "All of it unpaved. It was built in the 1950s, below the island in the Sky Mesa.", "words": [[114.23, 114.47, " All"], [114.47, 114.57, " of"], [114.57, 114.73, " it"], [114.73, 115.27, " unpaved."], [115.75, 115.91, " It"], [115.91, 116.09, " was"], [116.09, 116.29, " built"], [116.29, 116.47, " in"], [116.47, 116.57, " the"], [116.57, 117.63, " 1950s,"], [117.73, 118.05, " below"], [118.05, 118.35, " the"], [118.35, 118.61, " island"], [118.61, 118.77, " in"], [118.77, 118.95, " the"], [118.95, 119.15, " Sky"], [119.15, 119.49, " Mesa."]]}, {"start": 119.91, "end": 123.79, "text": "The reason was uranium. Prospectors needed to reach the deposits.", "words": [[119.91, 120.11, " The"], [120.11, 120.47, " reason"], [120.47, 120.73, " was"], [120.73, 121.31, " uranium."], [121.79, 122.39, " Prospectors"], [122.39, 122.67, " needed"], [122.67, 122.91, " to"], [122.91, 123.09, " reach"], [123.09, 123.33, " the"], [123.33, 123.79, " deposits."]]}, {"start": 124.25, "end": 129.05, "text": "Now see it from above, over the Green River. The river winds through canyons far below.", "words": [[124.25, 124.51, " Now"], [124.51, 124.67, " see"], [124.67, 124.81, " it"], [124.81, 124.99, " from"], [124.99, 125.37, " above,"], [125.53, 125.75, " over"], [125.75, 125.91, " the"], [125.91, 126.13, " Green"], [126.13, 126.51, " River."], [126.89, 127.07, " The"], [127.07, 127.31, " river"], [127.31, 127.59, " winds"], [127.59, 127.89, " through"], [127.89, 128.33, " canyons"], [128.33, 128.61, " far"], [128.61, 129.05, " below."]]}, {"start": 129.59, "end": 136.92, "text": "Verdict an honest frame. A spectacular daytime eruption. But this volcano has a", "words": [[129.59, 130.05, " Verdict"], [130.05, 130.31, " an"], [130.31, 130.59, " honest"], [130.59, 130.97, " frame."], [133.2, 133.44, " A"], [133.44, 134.04, " spectacular"], [134.04, 134.48, " daytime"], [134.48, 134.96, " eruption."], [135.46, 135.62, " But"], [135.62, 135.86, " this"], [135.86, 136.32, " volcano"], [136.32, 136.72, " has"], [136.72, 136.92, " a"]]}, {"start": 136.92, "end": 145.0, "text": "second face. Fuego in Guatemala is almost constantly active. A small explosion from the crater", "words": [[136.92, 137.0, " second"], [137.0, 137.56, " face."], [140.06, 140.28, " Fuego"], [140.28, 140.46, " in"], [140.46, 140.92, " Guatemala"], [140.92, 141.42, " is"], [141.42, 141.82, " almost"], [141.82, 142.34, " constantly"], [142.34, 142.86, " active."], [143.28, 143.48, " A"], [143.48, 143.76, " small"], [143.76, 144.36, " explosion"], [144.36, 144.56, " from"], [144.56, 144.76, " the"], [144.76, 145.0, " crater"]]}, {"start": 145.0, "end": 151.32, "text": "every 15 to 20 minutes. At night the crater glows red. This is November 2017.", "words": [[145.0, 145.62, " every"], [145.62, 146.1, " 15"], [146.1, 146.24, " to"], [146.24, 146.52, " 20"], [146.52, 146.96, " minutes."], [147.3, 147.54, " At"], [147.54, 147.74, " night"], [147.74, 147.88, " the"], [147.88, 148.16, " crater"], [148.16, 148.56, " glows"], [148.56, 148.88, " red."], [149.32, 149.56, " This"], [149.56, 149.86, " is"], [149.86, 150.28, " November"], [150.28, 151.32, " 2017."]]}, {"start": 151.76, "end": 158.3, "text": "Larger eruptions. Over 80 since 1999. One of them, the 31st of January 2018.", "words": [[151.76, 152.1, " Larger"], [152.1, 152.74, " eruptions."], [153.08, 153.34, " Over"], [153.34, 153.62, " 80"], [153.62, 153.92, " since"], [153.92, 154.7, " 1999."], [155.34, 155.52, " One"], [155.52, 155.7, " of"], [155.7, 155.88, " them,"], [156.2, 156.36, " the"], [156.36, 156.96, " 31st"], [156.96, 157.04, " of"], [157.04, 157.58, " January"], [157.58, 158.3, " 2018."]]}, {"start": 158.82, "end": 164.04, "text": "A day later the Landsat 8 satellite photographed the ash plume. Verdict the frame chooses.", "words": [[158.82, 158.94, " A"], [158.94, 159.1, " day"], [159.1, 159.34, " later"], [159.34, 159.56, " the"], [159.56, 159.96, " Landsat"], [159.96, 160.18, " 8"], [160.18, 160.68, " satellite"], [160.68, 161.36, " photographed"], [161.36, 161.66, " the"], [161.66, 161.9, " ash"], [161.9, 162.26, " plume."], [162.82, 163.1, " Verdict"], [163.1, 163.32, " the"], [163.32, 163.54, " frame"], [163.54, 164.04, " chooses."]]}, {"start": 165.42, "end": 172.08, "text": "A viewpoint and one canyon slope. Is this the whole Copper Canyon? No, it is one piece of it.", "words": [[165.42, 166.02, " A"], [166.02, 166.5, " viewpoint"], [166.5, 166.82, " and"], [166.82, 167.06, " one"], [167.06, 167.4, " canyon"], [167.4, 167.78, " slope."], [168.32, 168.4, " Is"], [168.4, 168.62, " this"], [168.62, 168.82, " the"], [168.82, 169.02, " whole"], [169.02, 169.38, " Copper"], [169.38, 169.76, " Canyon?"], [170.28, 170.64, " No,"], [170.64, 170.82, " it"], [170.82, 171.06, " is"], [171.06, 171.28, " one"], [171.28, 171.5, " piece"], [171.5, 171.66, " of"], [171.66, 172.08, " it."]]}, {"start": 173.99, "end": 178.33, "text": "Copper Canyon is not one canyon. It is a system of six canyons.", "words": [[173.99, 174.31, " Copper"], [174.31, 174.73, " Canyon"], [174.73, 175.07, " is"], [175.07, 175.29, " not"], [175.29, 175.53, " one"], [175.53, 175.93, 